  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="sub">Secret Travel &amp; Tour and VIP Taxi Lanta</p>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: 12 November 2026</p>

  <h2>1. Who is responsible for your data</h2>
  <p>Zwald Travel Planner Co., Ltd., 292 Moo 2, Sala Dan, Koh Lanta Yai, Krabi 81150, Thailand, company registration no. 0815569000065. The company operates Secret Travel &amp; Tour and sells the VIP Taxi Lanta transfers. Contact: WhatsApp +66 95 868 38 46.</p>

  <h2>2. What this website collects</h2>
  <p>This website does not ask you for personal details. It has no account and no newsletter, and its forms send nothing to our servers. The tour and transfer forms only prepare a WhatsApp message on your device. Nothing reaches us until you send that message yourself in WhatsApp. When you browse, the data handled is technical, such as your IP address in the host's logs (see section 6), plus the audience measurement described in section 3 if you accept it.</p>

  <h2 id="cookies">3. Cookies and statistics</h2>
  <p>This website counts visits with Google Analytics 4, but only if you accept. A notice asks you when you first arrive. Until you choose, and if you decline, no cookie is set and nothing is sent to Google.</p>
  <p>If you accept:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Google Analytics records which pages you view and roughly where the visit comes from: country, type of device, browser and the website that sent you.</li>
    <li>It records one action of its own: when you tap “Send on WhatsApp”, we note that it happened and the type of service, such as tour or transfer. We do not record your name, phone number, hotel, dates or the message itself.</li>
    <li>Google Analytics sets two cookies on your device, <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_</code> followed by our measurement ID. They last up to 2 years.</li>
    <li>Advertising is switched off: no advertising cookies, no personalised ads, and your data is not shared for advertising.</li>
    <li>Google processes this data on its own servers, which may be outside your country, under its own privacy policy.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Your choice is kept on your device, not in a cookie, for 6 months, then we ask again. To change your mind, use “Cookie settings” at the bottom of any page. If you decline after accepting, the Google Analytics cookies are removed from your device. The legal basis is your consent.</p>

  <h2>4. Form drafts on your device</h2>
  <p>So that you do not have to type everything again, the tour request form keeps a draft in your browser's storage, on your device only. It is never sent to us. It is ignored after 7 days, and the “Clear form” button deletes it at once.</p>

  <h2>5. What we do with your booking details</h2>
  <p>When you write to us, we receive what you choose to send, such as your name, phone number, dates, pickup place, the number and age of travellers or a flight number. We use these details only to answer you and handle your booking. We share with the partner carrying out the service only the details it needs. We never sell your details or use them for advertising.</p>

  <h2>6. Services we rely on</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>WhatsApp (Meta) carries our messages, under its own privacy policy.</li>
    <li>Google Analytics measures visits, only if you accept (see section 3), under Google's own privacy policy.</li>
    <li>Netlify hosts this website and may keep technical logs, such as IP addresses, to deliver it securely.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. How long we keep your details</h2>
  <p>We keep your details for as long as we need them to handle your booking, then for as long as Thai accounting and tax rules require.</p>

  <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask us at any time to see, correct or delete your details, or object to their use. Write to us on WhatsApp at +66 95 868 38 46. These rights come from Thailand's Personal Data Protection Act B.E. 2562 and, if you live in the European Union, from the GDPR.</p>

  <h2>9. Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows the current version. See also our <a href="/terms/">booking terms</a> and our <a href="/legal/">legal notice</a>.</p>
